  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support on Public Financial Management.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide flexible bilateral Public Financial Management technical assistance to Government of Nepal, complementing our World Bank Multi Donor Trust Fund support, further supporting Government of Nepal in PFM systems strengthening and effectively manage fiduciary risks across British Embassy Kathmandu portfolio, while we develop the new governance business case.</narrative>
  </description>
